WEBVTT

00:00.696 --> 00:03.696
[island music]
[岛屿音乐]

00:03.696 --> 00:09.862
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:09.862 --> 00:13.229
[Calypso music playing]
[卡里普索音乐演奏]

00:13.229 --> 00:15.729
[laughter]
[笑声]

00:15.729 --> 00:16.729
- Cha cha!
- 恰恰！

00:16.729 --> 00:18.596
[laughter]
[笑声]

00:18.596 --> 00:20.262
- More fruit punch,
SpongeBob?
- 更多水果潘趣酒，
海绵宝宝？

00:20.262 --> 00:22.396
- You know Plankton,
when you invited me over,
- 你知道浮游生物，
当你邀请我过来的时候

00:22.396 --> 00:25.362
I thought it was another trick
to get the Krabby Patty formula.
我以为这是另一个伎俩
获得蟹黄饼配方。

00:25.362 --> 00:26.929
Now I see you just love
现在我看到你只是爱

00:26.929 --> 00:28.696
social gatherings
in the workplace.
社交聚会
在工作场所。

00:28.696 --> 00:30.229
- Oh, I love
office parties.
- 哦，我爱
办公室聚会。

00:30.229 --> 00:33.462
We've got roller chair races
and karaoke.
我们有滚椅比赛
和卡拉OK。

00:33.462 --> 00:35.596
Hey, I know a gag
we could do--
嘿，我知道一个笑话
我们可以做——

00:35.596 --> 00:38.829
copy our faces
on the new copy machine.
复制我们的脸
在新复印机上。

00:38.829 --> 00:41.462
- Ooh, should I put my face
on the glass?
- 哦，我应该把我的脸
在玻璃上？

00:41.462 --> 00:43.496
- Why don't you lay
your whole body down?
- 你为什么不躺着
你整个身体都垮了吗？

00:43.496 --> 00:44.829
That glass is big enough.
这玻璃够大了

00:44.829 --> 00:48.029
- [grunting]
Blah.
- [咕哝]
废话。

00:48.029 --> 00:49.762
How's this?
Like this?
这怎么样？
像这样？

00:49.762 --> 00:51.796
What about this?
Is this good?
这又如何呢？
这好吗？

00:51.796 --> 00:53.896
- Just lay face down
and keep still.
- 脸朝下躺着
并保持静止。

00:53.896 --> 00:56.162
[grunts]
- Whoo! [giggles]
[咕哝]
- 呼！ [咯咯笑]

00:56.162 --> 00:58.196
- All right, party's over.
Go home.
- 好吧，聚会结束了。
回家吧。

00:58.196 --> 01:00.696
- Aw! But I'd like
some more fruit punch.
- 噢！但我想
再来一些水果潘趣酒。

01:00.696 --> 01:01.962
- No more punch for you.
- 不再给你打拳了。

01:01.962 --> 01:03.762
You don't look so good,
SpongeBob.
你看起来不太好，
海绵宝宝。

01:03.762 --> 01:05.696
I suggest you take
the day off tomorrow.
我建议你采取
明天休息。

01:05.696 --> 01:07.329
- Nah, I feel fine.
- 不，我感觉很好。

01:07.329 --> 01:08.796
- Are you sure?
- 你确定吗？

01:08.796 --> 01:10.762
- You know, now that you ask,
I don't know.
- 你知道，既然你问了，
我不知道。

01:10.762 --> 01:12.762
I think I just felt
a twinge.
我想我只是感觉到
一阵刺痛。

01:12.762 --> 01:15.062
- You'll be fine
if you take tomorrow off.
- 你会没事的
如果你明天请假的话。

01:15.062 --> 01:17.196
[grunts]
[snickers]
[咕哝]
[窃笑]

01:20.696 --> 01:23.562
- Yay!
- Hello, SpongeBob CopyPants.
- 耶！
- 你好，海绵宝宝复制裤。

01:23.562 --> 01:25.796
Can you say,
"secret formula"?
你能说，
“秘密配方”？

01:25.796 --> 01:27.496
- "See-see for-ma-ma."
- “见见妈妈”。

01:27.496 --> 01:30.729
- "Se-cret form-ula."
- “秘密公式”。

01:30.729 --> 01:33.996
- Secret formula.
Secret formula.
- 秘密配方。
秘方。

01:33.996 --> 01:37.829
- [evil laugh]
Yeah.
- [邪恶的笑声]
是的。

01:37.829 --> 01:41.962
[evil laughter]
[邪恶的笑声]

01:43.396 --> 01:46.696
- Now remember, your name is
SpongeBob SquarePants
- 现在记住，你的名字是
海绵宝宝

01:46.696 --> 01:48.962
and your assignment is
to ask Krabs
你的任务是
去问蟹蟹

01:48.962 --> 01:51.262
for the secret
Krabby Patty formula.
为了秘密
蟹黄饼配方。

01:51.262 --> 01:53.096
- My name
is SpongeBob SquarePants,
- 我的名字
是海绵宝宝，

01:53.096 --> 01:54.896
and I want
the secret formula.
我想要
秘密公式。

01:54.896 --> 01:56.129
- Excellent.
- 出色的。

01:56.129 --> 01:58.396
Now off you go.
Wait!
现在你走吧。
等待！

01:59.862 --> 02:02.696
Just keeping track
of my copy.
只是跟踪
我的副本。

02:02.696 --> 02:05.229
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

02:05.229 --> 02:08.362
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

02:08.362 --> 02:09.496
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

02:09.496 --> 02:10.762
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

02:10.762 --> 02:11.996
- What are you doing here?
- Oh!
- 你在这里做什么？
- 哦！

02:11.996 --> 02:13.396
- You said you would
take the day off!
- 你说过你会的
请一天假！

02:13.396 --> 02:14.729
- But I feel great today.
- 但我今天感觉很好。

02:14.729 --> 02:17.496
- Are you sure?
Because you're sweating.
- 你确定吗？
因为你出汗了。

02:17.496 --> 02:19.162
- Ooh.
- 哦。

02:19.162 --> 02:21.396
- [panting]
But you can't work,
- [气喘吁吁]
但你不能工作，

02:21.396 --> 02:23.196
you have
yellow jaundice!
你有
黄疸！

02:23.196 --> 02:24.496
- [laughs]
- [笑]

02:24.496 --> 02:27.829
Oh, Plankton,
yellow is my natural color.
哦，浮游生物，
黄色是我的自然颜色。

02:27.829 --> 02:28.862
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

02:28.862 --> 02:30.896
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

02:30.896 --> 02:32.862
Morning. [humming]
- Whatever.
早晨。 [嗡嗡声]
- 无论如何。

02:32.862 --> 02:35.362
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

02:35.362 --> 02:36.562
Morning.
[humming]
早晨。
[嗡嗡声]

02:36.562 --> 02:39.129
- I said whatever.
- 我说随便吧。

02:39.129 --> 02:40.829
Wait. Didn't I just--
Didn't I--
等待。我不是刚刚——
我不是——

02:40.829 --> 02:44.162
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

02:44.162 --> 02:44.962
- Boo!
- 嘘！

02:44.962 --> 02:46.696
- Ooh.
- Ooh.
- 哦。
- 哦。

02:46.696 --> 02:47.929
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

02:47.929 --> 02:49.696
- There's only one
explanation.
- 只有一个
解释。

02:49.696 --> 02:53.896
I'm still in bed,
and I'm having a nightmare!
我还在床上，
我正在做噩梦！

02:53.896 --> 02:56.062
[groans]
Wake up!
[呻吟]
醒醒吧！

02:57.129 --> 02:58.062
Wake up!
醒醒吧！

02:59.129 --> 03:01.029
Wake up!
醒醒吧！

03:01.029 --> 03:03.329
- Hey, I'd like to place
an order for two.
- 嘿，我想放置
两人份的订单。

03:03.329 --> 03:05.762
- Two?
As in two SpongeBobs?
- 二？
就像两个海绵宝宝一样？

03:05.762 --> 03:06.962
Sure.
当然。

03:06.962 --> 03:08.962
This is all just
a bad dream, right?
这一切都只是
一个噩梦，对吧？

03:08.962 --> 03:12.262
I'm dreaming.
You're in my dream.
我在做梦。
你在我的梦里。

03:12.262 --> 03:14.696
- That's me,
the man of your dreams.
- 这就是我，
你的梦中情人。

03:14.696 --> 03:16.162
[chuckles]
[笑声]

03:16.162 --> 03:18.829
- If this is a dream,
there are no consequences.
——如果这是梦的话
没有任何后果。

03:18.829 --> 03:21.829
I can do anything!
我什么都可以做！

03:21.829 --> 03:23.829
Hmm.
Dink!
唔。
丁克！

03:23.829 --> 03:24.829
Huh?
啊？

03:24.829 --> 03:27.462
I really am dreaming.
我真的是在做梦。

03:29.362 --> 03:31.196
- What's your name,
handsome stranger?
- 你叫什么名字
帅气的陌生人？

03:31.196 --> 03:33.562
- My name is
SpongeBob SquarePants.
- 我的名字是
海绵宝宝。

03:33.562 --> 03:34.929
- Wow!
We look alike,
- 哇！
我们长得很像

03:34.929 --> 03:36.596
and we have the same name.
我们有相同的名字。

03:36.596 --> 03:38.962
That's two things
we have in common.
这是两件事
我们有共同点。

03:38.962 --> 03:40.162
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

03:40.162 --> 03:42.296
I always wanted
a twin brother.
我一直想要
一个双胞胎兄弟。

03:42.296 --> 03:44.329
How do you feel
about bubbles?
你感觉如何
关于气泡？

03:44.329 --> 03:45.796
- I love 'em!
- 我爱他们！

03:45.796 --> 03:46.829
- Jelly fishing?
- 果冻钓鱼？

03:46.829 --> 03:48.962
- The same thing you do.
- 你也做同样的事。

03:49.829 --> 03:51.696
- How about Squidward?
- 章鱼哥怎么样？

03:51.696 --> 03:53.962
- Oh, "puh-leaze."
- 哦，“噗-莱兹”。

03:53.962 --> 03:55.329
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

03:55.329 --> 03:58.562
- I think I'll nickname you...
Me Two.
- 我想我会给你起个绰号...
我两个。

03:58.562 --> 03:59.696
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

03:59.696 --> 04:01.862
- Hey, SpongeCopy,
good to see ya.
- 嘿，海绵复制，
很高兴见到你。

04:01.862 --> 04:03.696
Have you learned
the secret formula yet?
你学会了吗
秘方还没？

04:03.696 --> 04:05.762
- Oh, I can't tell you that.
It's a secret.
- 哦，我不能告诉你。
这是一个秘密。

04:05.762 --> 04:07.896
Oh, by the way,
my name is Me Two.
哦，顺便说一下，
我的名字是我二号。

04:07.896 --> 04:09.696
- Me two?
- 我两个？

04:09.696 --> 04:11.996
I'm such a deep sea dope.
我真是个深海迷。

04:11.996 --> 04:13.696
Now that the copy
has come into contact
现在副本
已经接触过

04:13.696 --> 04:17.062
with the original SpongeBob,
he won't tell me the formula.
与最初的海绵宝宝一样，
他不会告诉我公式。

04:17.962 --> 04:20.696
[groaning]
[呻吟]

04:20.696 --> 04:22.996
Time to adjust
my plan.
调整时间
我的计划。

04:24.862 --> 04:26.329
- Wait a minute.
- 等一下。

04:26.329 --> 04:28.429
I can't afford
two SpongeBobs!
我买不起
两个海绵宝宝！

04:28.429 --> 04:31.462
If this is a scheme
to collect two paychecks,
如果这是一个方案
收取两份薪水，

04:31.462 --> 04:32.829
forget about it!
忘了它吧！

04:32.829 --> 04:34.996
You're getting one paycheck
split in two.
你得到一份薪水
分成两半。

04:34.996 --> 04:38.129
both: You are too good to us,
Mr. Krabs.
两人：你对我们太好了，
蟹老板。

04:39.596 --> 04:41.696
- [laughing]
- [笑]

04:41.696 --> 04:45.562
Karen, did you know
you're married to a genius?
凯伦，你知道吗
你嫁给了一个天才？

04:45.562 --> 04:47.496
- How could I forget?
- 我怎么能忘记呢？

04:47.496 --> 04:49.896
You had it tattooed
on my hard drive.
你把它纹身了
在我的硬盘上。

04:49.896 --> 04:51.262
- Now where was I?
- 现在我在哪里？

04:51.262 --> 04:54.462
Oh, yeah, I saved
SpongeBob's digital DNA.
哦，是的，我救了
海绵宝宝的数字 DNA。

04:58.696 --> 05:00.762
- Yay!
- [evil laugh]
- 耶！
- [邪恶的笑声]

05:00.762 --> 05:02.696
- Ooh!
- 哦！

05:02.696 --> 05:04.129
- No, no, SpongeCopy.
- 不，不，SpongeCopy。

05:04.129 --> 05:06.729
We don't put dirty, nasty things
in our mouth.
我们不放置肮脏、令人讨厌的东西
在我们嘴里。

05:06.729 --> 05:07.862
Spit it out.
吐出来。

05:11.329 --> 05:12.696
- Yuck!
- 恶心！

05:12.696 --> 05:13.896
Now, Listen!
现在，听着！

05:13.896 --> 05:16.062
Your name is
SpongeBob SquarePants,
你的名字是
海绵宝宝，

05:16.062 --> 05:18.329
and you're to go
straight to Mr. Krabs
你要走了
直接去找蟹老板

05:18.329 --> 05:21.029
and ask him
for the secret formula.
并问他
为秘密配方。

05:21.029 --> 05:23.262
- Mr. Krabs, secret formula.
Got it.
- 蟹老板，秘密配方。
知道了。

05:23.262 --> 05:25.929
- And stay away
from any other SpongeBobs!
- 并远离
来自任何其他海绵宝宝！

05:25.929 --> 05:27.429
- Got it.
- 知道了。

05:27.429 --> 05:29.729
- Ah, ah,
SpongeCopy.
- 啊啊啊
海绵复制。

05:29.729 --> 05:31.362
- [groans]
- [grunts]
- [呻吟]
- [咕哝]

05:31.362 --> 05:33.496
You see, this is why
I never had children.
你看，这就是原因
我从未生过孩子。

05:34.729 --> 05:35.962
- [gulping]
- [吞咽]

05:35.962 --> 05:38.029
- Yup,
I'm still dreaming.
- 是的，
我还在做梦。

05:38.029 --> 05:42.262
Hello there.
Are you enjoying my dream?
你好呀。
你享受我的梦想吗？

05:42.262 --> 05:45.329
Ha! I heard you liked
your patties ground.
哈!我听说你喜欢
你的肉饼磨碎了。

05:45.329 --> 05:47.396
[laughs]
- [moans]
[笑]
- [呻吟]

05:47.396 --> 05:49.229
- [gasps]
Mister Squidward!
- [喘气]
章鱼哥先生！

05:49.229 --> 05:51.262
Just what the devilfish
do you think you're doing?
到底是什么魔鬼鱼
你认为你在做什么？

05:51.262 --> 05:53.796
- Isn't it obvious,
you red-faced tightwad?
- 这不是很明显吗
你这个红脸小气鬼？

05:53.796 --> 05:56.396
I'm dreaming.
我在做梦。

05:56.396 --> 05:58.262
What's that
under there?
那是什么
在那下面？

05:58.262 --> 05:59.462
- Under where?
Ooh!
- 在哪里？
哦！

05:59.462 --> 06:00.462
- That's right.
- 这是正确的。

06:00.462 --> 06:01.996
[laughs]
[笑]

06:01.996 --> 06:04.096
* I don't care,
I don't care *
*我不在乎，
我不在乎*

06:04.096 --> 06:06.096
* None of this is real
*这一切都不是真实的

06:07.196 --> 06:09.862
Hm.
I always wanted to fly,
嗯。
我一直想飞翔

06:09.862 --> 06:13.929
and since this is my dream,
I'm going to fly!
既然这是我的梦想，
我要飞了！

06:13.929 --> 06:15.129
[laughs]
[笑]

06:16.929 --> 06:18.396
- Hello, Mr. Krabs.
- 你好，蟹老板。

06:18.396 --> 06:20.696
Hey, can you tell me
the secret Krabby Patty formula?
嘿，你能告诉我吗
蟹黄派的秘密配方？

06:20.696 --> 06:22.696
- You want me to tell you
the "formular"?
- 你想让我告诉你
“公式”？

06:22.696 --> 06:24.729
That's quite a responsibility,
laddie.
这是一份很大的责任，
小伙子。

06:24.729 --> 06:26.262
- Secret formula.
- 秘密配方。

06:26.262 --> 06:27.929
- Well, you make
a good point.
- 好吧，你让
一个好点。

06:27.929 --> 06:29.696
Lean in, boy.
靠过来，男孩。

06:29.696 --> 06:31.062
[eerie hum]
[诡异的嗡嗡声]

06:31.062 --> 06:33.729
- He's doing it!
- 他正在做！

06:33.729 --> 06:36.129
He knows the formula!
他知道这个公式！

06:36.129 --> 06:38.196
I can taste triumph.
我能尝到胜利的滋味。

06:38.196 --> 06:40.696
Wait.
No. No!
等待。
不，不！

06:40.696 --> 06:42.129
- Secret formula.
Secret formula.
- 秘密配方。
秘方。

06:42.129 --> 06:44.429
- Hey, look,
another handsome devil.
- 嘿，看，
另一个英俊的恶魔。

06:44.429 --> 06:47.029
[laughs]
We'll call you Me Three.
[笑]
我们就叫你“我三号”吧。

06:47.029 --> 06:48.296
[all laugh]
[全都笑]

06:48.296 --> 06:50.562
Aw, let's go
flip some patties.
噢，我们走吧
翻转一些肉饼。

06:50.562 --> 06:52.496
- Neptune's puddle!
[grunts]
- 海王星的水坑！
[咕哝]

06:52.496 --> 06:55.596
Now that SpongeBob's been
corrupted by the other two!
现在海绵宝宝已经
被另外两个破坏了！

06:55.596 --> 07:01.729
What I need is a legion of Bobs,
a full-on blitzkrieg of Bobs!
我需要的是一大批鲍勃，
鲍勃的全面闪电战！

07:03.196 --> 07:06.296
[military drumming]
[军鼓]

07:06.296 --> 07:11.462
March. March, my pretties,
and learn the formula.
行进。三月，我的美人，
并学习公式。

07:11.462 --> 07:12.896
[evil laugh]
[邪恶的笑声]

07:12.896 --> 07:16.696
[all humming in unison]
[大家齐声哼唱]

07:16.696 --> 07:19.229
all: Secret formula.
全部：秘密配方。

07:19.229 --> 07:20.562
- Whoa, you guys are multiplying
- 哇，你们正在成倍增加

07:20.562 --> 07:21.862
faster than sea bunnies.
all: Secret formula.
比海兔还快。
全部：秘密配方。

07:21.862 --> 07:23.362
- All right, pipe down.
- 好吧，放下管道。

07:23.362 --> 07:25.196
I'm only gonna tell you
the secret formula
我只会告诉你
秘密公式

07:25.196 --> 07:26.429
one more time.
再一次。

07:26.429 --> 07:28.962
all: One more time.
全体：再来一次。

07:28.962 --> 07:30.262
[all humming in unison]
[大家齐声哼唱]

07:30.262 --> 07:32.362
- So you've all memorized
the formula.
- 所以你们都记住了
公式。

07:32.362 --> 07:35.696
Get to work, while I calculate
your paychecks.
开始工作，我一边计算
你的薪水。

07:35.696 --> 07:37.529
all: Yay! Hooray!
全体：耶！万岁！

07:38.529 --> 07:40.596
- They all know
the formula.
- 他们都知道
公式。

07:41.696 --> 07:42.596
- I'll do that.
- 我会这么做的。

07:42.596 --> 07:43.762
- Oh.
Okay, thanks.
- 哦。
好的，谢谢。

07:44.862 --> 07:46.696
- Let me do that.
- Sure.
- 让我来做吧。
- 当然。

07:48.529 --> 07:50.862
- I'll polish
the pickles.
- 我会抛光
泡菜。

07:50.862 --> 07:53.162
- Looks like you sponges
have everything covered.
- 看起来你像海绵
一切都已涵盖。

07:53.162 --> 07:54.696
- Mm-hmm.
- 嗯嗯。

07:54.696 --> 07:56.096
- Hey, you don't
look so good.
- 嘿，你不
看起来很好。

07:56.096 --> 07:58.062
Can I take you home?
Where do you live?
我可以送你回家吗？
你住在哪里？

07:58.062 --> 07:59.262
- I came
from the Chum Bucket.
- 我来了
来自密友桶。

07:59.262 --> 08:01.162
- The Chum Bucket?
- 密友桶？

08:01.162 --> 08:04.296
- * I'm gonna know the formula
I'm gonna know the formula *
- * 我要知道公式
我要知道公式 *

08:04.296 --> 08:05.596
- Plankton!
- 浮游生物！

08:05.596 --> 08:08.129
Me Two says you made him
in a copy machine
我二号说是你创造了他
在复印机中

08:08.129 --> 08:10.229
so that you could steal
the secret formula.
这样你就可以偷东西
秘密公式。

08:10.229 --> 08:12.896
- Well, that's
patently ridiculous.
- 嗯，那就是
显然是荒谬的。

08:12.896 --> 08:13.962
- Uhh...
- 呃...

08:13.962 --> 08:15.229
- You gotta help him.
- 你得帮助他。

08:15.229 --> 08:16.996
I think he's sick
or something.
我觉得他有病
或者什么的。

08:16.996 --> 08:19.462
- I feel funny.
- 我觉得很有趣。

08:20.462 --> 08:22.196
- Me Two!
Me Two!
- 我两个！
我两个！

08:22.196 --> 08:23.696
Oh, what happened to him?
哦，他怎么了？

08:23.696 --> 08:25.096
- I was afraid of that.
- 我很害怕。

08:25.096 --> 08:27.496
I thought I'd save some money
by using cheap toner.
我以为我可以省点钱
使用廉价碳粉。

08:27.496 --> 08:28.529
- What's that mean?
- 那是什么意思？

08:28.529 --> 08:30.696
- It means my plan is ruined!
——这意味着我的计划泡汤了！

08:30.696 --> 08:34.096
All the SpongeBob copies
will fade away now.
所有海绵宝宝副本
现在将会消失。

08:34.096 --> 08:36.929
- Fade away?
All my brand-new friends?
- 消失？
我所有的新朋友？

08:36.929 --> 08:39.596
No, they can't!
不，他们不能！

08:39.596 --> 08:43.262
[crying]
[哭泣]

08:43.262 --> 08:45.396
No!
Don't disappear!
不！
别消失！

08:47.729 --> 08:49.496
[crying]
[哭泣]

08:49.496 --> 08:51.729
- Quickly, man, before you fade!
What's the formula?
- 快点，伙计，在你消失之前！
公式是什么？

08:51.729 --> 08:53.462
- It's easy.
You take one part--
- 这很容易。
你参与其中的一部分——

08:53.462 --> 08:55.796
[grunts]
I don't feel so good.
[咕哝]
我感觉不太好。

08:55.796 --> 08:57.362
- Wait.
No!
- 等待。
不！

08:57.362 --> 08:58.662
You, the formula!
你，公式！

08:59.729 --> 09:00.662
The formula.
公式。

09:01.929 --> 09:03.062
The formula!
公式！

09:04.162 --> 09:06.029
The formula!
公式！

09:06.029 --> 09:07.362
Ouch!
哎哟!

09:07.362 --> 09:08.696
[all groaning]
The formula! The formula!
[全都呻吟]
公式！公式！

09:08.696 --> 09:10.462
The formula!
公式！

09:12.929 --> 09:15.262
[all laughing]
[全都笑了]

09:16.562 --> 09:20.396
- Life is
but a walking shadow.
- 生活就是
而是一个行走的影子。

09:20.396 --> 09:23.429
Ah-loobie-loobie-loobie-loobie-
loobie-loobie--
啊-loobie-loobie-loobie-loobie-
卢比-卢比--

09:23.429 --> 09:25.496
[starts]
[screams]
[开始]
[尖叫声]

09:25.496 --> 09:27.162
all:
Loobie-loobie-loobie!
全部：
卢比卢比卢比！

09:28.229 --> 09:29.862
- What's the formula?
- 公式是什么？

09:30.929 --> 09:32.329
- Well, I did it.
- 嗯，我做到了。

09:32.329 --> 09:34.196
I calculated one paycheck
我计算了一份薪水

09:34.196 --> 09:37.329
down into 300 separate
tiny checks.
分成300个单独的
小支票。

09:37.329 --> 09:39.129
Only one of you left?
你们只剩下一个人了吗？

09:39.129 --> 09:40.596
Here.
这里。

09:40.596 --> 09:41.696
- Ah.
- 啊。

09:41.696 --> 09:42.596
[groans]
[呻吟]

09:43.696 --> 09:45.729
- Sheesh,
what a cheapskate.
- 谢什，
真是个小气鬼。

09:47.562 --> 09:50.862
I can't believe
I failed again!
我不敢相信
我又失败了！

09:50.862 --> 09:51.929
- I can believe it.
- 我可以相信。

09:51.929 --> 09:53.296
- Wait, are you a copy?
- 等等，你是复制品吗？

09:53.296 --> 09:54.862
Quick,
what's the formula?
快点，
公式是什么？

09:54.862 --> 09:56.362
- Well, you see, it's--
- 嗯，你看，这是--

09:56.362 --> 09:59.296
Nice try, Plankton,
but I'm the O.S.--
不错的尝试，浮游生物，
但我是操作系统——

09:59.296 --> 10:02.362
the Original Sponge.
[whimpers]
原来的海绵。
[呜咽]

10:02.362 --> 10:04.696
I can't believe
they're all gone.
我不敢相信
他们都走了。

10:04.696 --> 10:07.529
- Oh, you wouldn't want
all those copies of you around.
-哦，你不会想要的
周围所有那些你的复制品。

10:07.529 --> 10:09.729
They were all just imitations,
anyway.
都只是仿制品，
无论如何。

10:09.729 --> 10:11.696
- Hey, those imitations
were my friends.
- 嘿，那些仿制品
是我的朋友。

10:11.696 --> 10:15.696
- One SpongeBob is more than
the world can handle anyway.
- 一个海绵宝宝不仅仅是
无论如何，世界都能应付。

10:15.696 --> 10:17.496
You're a unique snowflake.
你是独一无二的雪花。

10:17.496 --> 10:19.162
- Yeah.
Thanks, Plankton.
- 是的。
谢谢，浮游生物。

10:19.162 --> 10:22.062
Things did get a bit out of hand
with all those me's around.
事情确实有点失控了
和我身边的所有人。

10:22.062 --> 10:23.696
- Yeah,
you're pretty annoying.
- 是的，
你真烦人。

10:23.696 --> 10:26.896
Well, you can stomp on me now
if that's what you want.
好吧，你现在可以踩我了
如果这就是你想要的。

10:26.896 --> 10:30.296
- Plankton,
I am unique snowflake,
- 浮游生物，
我是独一无二的雪花，

10:30.296 --> 10:33.929
and snowflakes don't stomp.
They skip!
雪花不会踩踏。
他们跳过！

10:33.929 --> 10:35.862
[laughs]
[笑]

10:37.129 --> 10:38.729
- Well, what do ya know
about that?
- 嗯，你知道什么
关于那个？

10:38.729 --> 10:39.696
No comeuppance.
没有报应。

10:39.696 --> 10:40.796
- Gaining speed.
- [gulps]
- 加快速度。
- [吞咽]

10:40.796 --> 10:42.962
- Increasing thrust,
raising nose,
- 增加推力，
抬起鼻子，

10:42.962 --> 10:44.429
air pressure on tentacles,
触手上的气压，

10:44.429 --> 10:46.162
tray tables
in upright positions,
托盘桌
处于直立位置时，

10:46.162 --> 10:48.229
and...liftoff!
还有……升空！

10:48.229 --> 10:49.996
- Eh, spoke too soon.
- 呃，说得太早了。

10:49.996 --> 10:51.396
Comeuppance
in three, two--
报应
三、二——

10:51.396 --> 10:52.396
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

10:52.396 --> 10:54.062
[both groaning]
[两人都呻吟]

10:54.062 --> 10:57.196
- [groans]
Right on my keys.
- [呻吟]
就在我的钥匙上。

10:59.929 --> 11:02.929
[quirky island music]
[古怪的岛屿音乐]

11:02.929 --> 11:10.862
*
*
*
*

*